## ✅ Post-Configuration Verification

Verify an object's location and membership directly from the AD Database:

# View specific user details and DN
Get-ADUser -Identity "admin.user"

# View all members inside a specific security group
Get-ADGroupMember -Identity "HR-Folder-Access"

